The '''Tewtil Tunnel''' is a {{Skl|Fishing}} [[Locations|Location]] on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}} that contains {{MobSprite|Tewtil}}s.

== Features ==
The '''Tewtil Tunnel''' primarily serves as a place for {{MobSprite|Tewtil}}s to spawn, which can be fed [[Trophy Frogs]] to be exploded, granting the {{Item|Tewtil Shard}}. It also features {{MobSprite|Lotum}}s, which can be punched to obtain the {{Item|Lotum Shard}}, as well as the [[Lotus Atoll#Lily Pads|Lily Pads]], which can be merged together to obtain the {{Item|Exploding Frog}} [[Trophy Frog]].

